# Generated by `make apk` from the files beside it: the list of every asset
# path, which squared uses to answer directory questions on device. Rebuilt
# whenever an asset changes, so committing it would only produce noise.
#
# Exactly the index file, not all of SQ-INF/: if a bundle manifest ever
# lives there it is written by hand and belongs in version control.
#
# Lives here rather than in assets/ itself: a .gitignore inside assets/ would
# be packaged into the APK and listed in the index.
assets/SQ-INF/index
